\pard\b\fs20 Breakthrough While Digging\b0\par
\fs16\par
If the clonk digs over another tunnel, cave or the like and the layer of earth between the digger and the open space is too thin, it collapses. Script.c contains the parameters, which can be overloaded in your own scenario as needed.\par
The more often this rule is selected, the thinner the earth may be before the clonk breaks through.\par
Should always be used with 'Breaking Tunnel Ends'.\par
}
